<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How enjoyable Thy table, Lord,</l><l>As we fellowship around it,</l><l>Hallelujah, we have found it,</l><l>How enjoyable Thy table, Lord!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Oh, how precious is Thy table, Lord—</l><l>Bread and wine Thy death announcing;</l><l>Here our soul-life we’re renouncing,</l><l>By partaking of Thy table, Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>How significant Thy table, Lord—</l><l>We Thy Body in the loaf seen,</l><l>Object of Thy love bespeaking;</l><l>How significant Thy table, Lord!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>How refreshing is Thy table, Lord—</l><l>So completely satisfying,</l><l>Day by day our need supplying;</l><l>How refreshing is Thy table, Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>How encouraging Thy table, Lord—</l><l>“Till He come,” its promise giving</l><l>Hope, to fill our daily living;</l><l>How encouraging Thy table, Lord!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
